{
 "title": "共享值与并行工作",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**`Shared[T]`** 把一个不可变的值交给多个所有者（`clone()` 增加一个所有者，最后一个放手时值被释放）。它适合被读取但不被修改的数据，比如配置。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "struct Config:",
    "    name: string",
    "    limits: List[i32]",
    "",
    "fn limit_sum(c: Shared[Config]) -> i32:",
    "    t = 0",
    "    for x in c.value.limits:",
    "        t += x",
    "    return t",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    limits = List[i32]()",
    "    limits.push(10)",
    "    limits.push(20)",
    "    cfg = Shared[Config](Config{ name: string.from(\"prod\"), limits: limits })",
    "    other = cfg.clone()",
    "    print(limit_sum(cfg), other.value.name.as_str())"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "30 prod"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "要在所有核心上处理一个大数组，`std.parallel` 提供了**线程池**：`Pool.new(n)`、`map_i64`、`map_f64`、`reduce_i64`、`reduce_f64` 和 `cpu_count()`。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.parallel",
    "",
    "fn square(x: i64) -> i64:",
    "    return x * x",
    "",
    "fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64:",
    "    return a + b",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    pool = parallel.Pool.new(parallel.cpu_count())",
    "    src = List[i64]()",
    "    for i in 1..=10:",
    "        src.push(i64(i))",
    "    dst = List[i64]()",
    "    for i in 1..=10:",
    "        dst.push(0)",
    "    parallel.map_i64(pool, src, dst, square)",
    "    print(parallel.reduce_i64(pool, dst, 0, add))"
   ],
   "run": false,
   "local": true
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c12-l05-q1",
   "q": "`Shared[T]` 适合哪种数据？",
   "options": [
    "不断变化的计数器",
    "被读取但不被修改的共享数据",
    "只有数字"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "对会变化的数据，使用 `Locked[T]` 或原子变量。"
  }
 ]
}
